follow these steps to get the app up and running.

📥 1. Download

Go to the Releases section of this GitHub repository.

Download the latest release.

Extract the .zip file somewhere convenient.

🛡️ 2. Windows Security

If Windows Security flags the application:

⚠️ Don't disable your antivirus completely.

Check Windows Security → Virus & threat protection → Protection history.

Verify that you downloaded the application from the correct GitHub release.

Only allow/run the file if you trust the source and have verified what you're downloading.

▶️ 3. Launch the App

Open the extracted folder.

Run the application's .exe.

Wait for the application to finish loading.

🎮 4. Open the Menu

Once the application is running:

Press F12 to open the menu. 📋

👁️ 5. Hide / Show the Menu

Press Insert to hide the menu. 👻

Press Insert again to show it.

⌨️ Hotkeys
Key Action
F12 📋 Open menu
Insert 👁️ Hide / show menu
❓ Troubleshooting

If the hotkeys aren't working:

Make sure the application is running. ▶️

Click the application window so it has focus. 🖱️

Try pressing F12 or Insert again.

Make sure another application isn't intercepting the keyboard shortcuts.

✅ Done!

You're all set! 🎉

F12 → Open menu 📋
Insert → Hide/show menu 👁️
